      "caption": "Assalamualaikum wr wb,\n\nJoin us this Friday at Al-Firdaus for a special Rabiulawal 1448H Maghrib kuliah, “The Prophet's Guidance: For The Forgiveness Of Past Sins”, delivered by Ustaz Hadi Jamil.\n\nThe kuliah will be conducted in Malay and English.\n\nSee you at Al-Firdaus, inshāAllāh.\n\n🕌\n\nContribute to Masjid Al-Firdaus:\n\n1. PayNow UEN: S62MQ0011J\n2. OCBC Wadiah Account: 517-147690-001\n\nMay Allah s.w.t reward your efforts abundantly. Āmīn.\n\n#Kuliah\n#Rabiulawal1448H\n#MasjidAlFirdaus \n#AlFirdausMosque \n#MovingTowardsJannatulFirdaus"
